<title>UK: BT says Norman Tebbitt retires from board.</title>
<headline>BT says Norman Tebbitt retires from board.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Telecommunications Plc said on Wednesday that former Conservative chairman Lord Norman Tebbitt has retired as a non-executive director of the company.</p>
<p>He had been a non-executive of the telecommunications giant since 1987.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
